---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Pricing for therapy practice marketing"
description: "Full Panel publishes its prices: practice growth audits, referral development, directories, SEO, ads and social strategy for therapy practices."
ctaHeading: "Start with a free Practice Snapshot."
---
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
      <h1 class="h1" style="max-width:760px">Clear prices, posted up front.</h1>
      <p class="lede">While others don’t, I publish my prices because I approach this work in the same way that I do therapy: with honesty and transparency.</p>
      <p class="meta-line">{{ pricing.tiers.small }}: {{ pricing.tiers.small_note }}. {{ pricing.tiers.large }}: {{ pricing.tiers.large_note }}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ul class="price-list">
        {%- for p in pricing.services %}
        <li class="price-row">
          <div class="price-name"><h2 class="h3">{{ p.name }}</h2><p>{{ p.included }}</p></div>
          <dl class="price-pair"><div><dt>{{ pricing.tiers.small }}</dt><dd>{{ p.small }}</dd></div><div><dt>{{ pricing.tiers.large }}</dt><dd>{{ p.large }}</dd></div></dl>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">How pricing works</p><h2 class="h2">No surprises, the same way you'd treat a client.</h2></div>
      <ul class="principles how-list">
        {%- for h in pricing.how %}
        <li><strong>{{ h[0] }}</strong> <span>{{ h[1] }}</span></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
